	(text "25MHz passive crystal (10 ppm)\nChosen over TCXO for BOM simplicity\n\nTarget CL = 9pF.\nAssuming stray capacitance Cs = 4pF,\nstandard CL1 = CL2 = 10pF (C0G/NP0) are used\n\nGain margin is ~13 (>> 5 minimum required by ST AN2867)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 73.66 91.44 0)
